    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Bryan Bowser",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104083515066565689088/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWHNnDIotRIHry_N4jF1g0Kum8781nXO6XAX-ij36jAh9a0w_FxZA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "For me, it's only practical function is for blood tests.\nI had a father with ALS. We saw a CLSC nurse only once when he was home that year. She saw him on a ventilator, left some gauze  and we never saw her again. NOVA came to the rescue and showed up every second day to help.\nIt was the same when my wife was sent home do die with Ovarian Cancer. I brought her home, scared as hell. I was told the CLSC would help. I saw a CLSC nurse once. That's it.\nAgain, NOVA came to the rescue. They were amazing. The CLSC were non existent.",
        "time": 1765894342,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "ThaQueenSS",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117584446601168645290/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIbfCagryfUBB_ZCl7Ep2Cpvrwf9d-SNrEF6iJJcllIW9M9jg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Volume d'appels élevé... All day long at the phone number provided no answer for over 45mins wait time morning, noon or after 1500 and online doesn't provide an option for the apointment needed. Truly ridiculous as if the phone number is given for a run around.",
        "time": 1767729289,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ben",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111509421589159212953/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJExrG7SwgNbH_d_WTTbGPLSi5kjnD-402RUCNOIEWzyPnqnQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Docteur Fadlallah refused to treat my mother who has a serious Kidney issue. Another Urologist in Ontario is taking over her case. He was going to do the surgery but refused after having it scheduled because she was asking questions!! Imagine refusing critical care because the patient is worried about side effects! He is not respecting his hippocratic oath. Not to mention recently arrived to Canada and treating patient like dirt. He should be investigated for putting a patient in Danger!!!",
        "time": 1732384846,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "farida Vaisheva",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117472941583011060148/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJz6MS2NLYHGoYzwm2DqstsEEOmI4PocWPQcnUXo0Z181tToQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "The staff is kind, professional,  and polite. The girl that is in Guichet C is perfect,  very nice,  professional,  and helpful.  She warks on weekends, and always ready to help and assist.  Her na",
        "time": 1745238138,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vahid Chaychi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104680520445071034247/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUuDaiKZkNGT_EtImi-JevxKSMquQ-jJorOjIJvhrEeHtYNm-ag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I cannot speak highly enough of the GMF section of this clinic. From the moment I first interacted with them, I have been consistently impressed by their exceptional service and unwavering dedication to patient care.\n\nOne of the standout features of this clinic is their staff. They are incredibly supportive and friendly, always ready to assist patients with a smile. What truly sets them apart is their responsiveness – they answer phone calls immediately and patiently spend time on the phone helping patients with their inquiries and concerns. This level of attentiveness and dedication to patient needs is truly commendable.\n\nMoreover, the organization of the clinic is impeccable. The waiting times are minimal, indicating a high level of efficiency and organization behind the scenes. This allows patients to receive timely care without unnecessary delays, which is a testament to the clinic's commitment to providing excellent service.\n\nHowever, the heart and soul of this clinic lie in its family doctor, Dr. Caroline Johnson. Dr. Johnson is an extraordinary individual who embodies compassion, kindness, and professionalism. She genuinely cares about her patients' problems and goes above and beyond to provide them with the support and care they need. Dr. Johnson's dedication is evident in her willingness to spend ample time with each patient, listening attentively to their concerns, and providing thorough diagnoses and treatment plans.\n\nDr. Johnson's patience, professionalism, and wealth of knowledge and experience are truly remarkable. She is a shining example of what a healthcare provider should strive to be – caring, compassionate, and dedicated to improving the lives of her patients.\n\nIn conclusion, the GMF section of this clinic, led by the exceptional Dr. Caroline Johnson, sets the standard for excellence in patient care. I am incredibly grateful for the outstanding service and care I have received here and wholeheartedly recommend this clinic to anyone in need of medical attention.",
        "time": 1711119484,
        "translated": false
      }
